# Dependencies.
#
# The dev shim under node_modules/ is a set of ABSOLUTE symlinks into
# ~/.dsh/profiles/web/node_modules. Committing it would bake one machine's
# profile path into the repo and break every other checkout. Recreate it per
# the README's "resolution requirement" section instead.
node_modules/

# Secrets.
#
# The credential resolution chain includes <cwd>/.env as a source, so a .env
# dropped in this directory would be a live secret sitting in the working tree.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Runtime state.
#
# The ledger normally lives under $DSH_HOME, outside this tree, but a test run
# or a changed DSH_HOME can drop one here. It records real spend.
ledger.json
ledger.json.tmp
*.tmp

# Local noise.
*.bak
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
